From: aiden build <build@aiden.local>
Subject: [PATCH] v8: include <cstdarg> for va_list

deps/v8/src/base/strings.h declares VSNPrintF with a va_list argument but
does not include the standard header that defines va_list. Some libstdc++
header combinations expose va_list transitively, but the Luckfox uClibc
cross toolchain used by Buildroot 2023.02.6 does not, so the target Node.js
16.20.0 build fails with:

  deps/v8/src/base/strings.h:23:53: error: 'va_list' has not been declared

Include <cstdarg> before the declaration.

Aiden-local patch.
---
--- a/deps/v8/src/base/strings.h
+++ b/deps/v8/src/base/strings.h
@@ -5,6 +5,8 @@
 #ifndef V8_BASE_STRINGS_H_
 #define V8_BASE_STRINGS_H_
 
+#include <cstdarg>
+
 #include "src/base/base-export.h"
 #include "src/base/macros.h"
 #include "src/base/vector.h"
